;	September 2, 1981 by S.B. - added romlw and romsw
;	September 10, 1981 by S.B. - fixed romic* len op
;	September 14, 1981 by S.B. - change gcptrs to gcstatic
;					add offsets for biblt and textscanner
;	September 17, 1981 by S.B. - add form offsets
;	September 24, 1981 by S.S. - add stack statistics stuff
;	September 25, 1981 by S.S. - add prefetch information
;	October 14, 1981 by S.S. - Add obj_ptrs bit
;	October 15, 1981 by S.S. - Add stored/touched macros
